The '''Port Town''' is the first [[Locations|island]] in the [[Third Sea]].

Upon first entering the [[Third Sea]], the player will be teleported to the docks of the Port Town, which is the main entrance to the island. The player can find the Port Town between [[Hydra Island]] and [[Haunted Castle]]. Going up the ramps the player will enter the main town of the island, where they will find the [[Pirate Millionaire]]s and [[Pistol Billionaire]]s. At the back of the island where the mountains are, the player should see some stairs along with a trail leading to the east side of the island where they will find [[Stone]], the [[bosses|boss]] of Port Town.

