==Notes==
* If an [[Elite Pirates|Elite Pirate]] spawns on the Port Town, it will only spawn behind the mountain in the back.
* The "[[Pineapple]]" fruit, required to complete the [[Hungry Man Quest]] (for [[Instinct V2]]), spawns near the [[Pistol Billionaire]]s.
** The player will lose the [[Pineapple]] if they die.
* [[Pirate Millionaire]]s drop {{Scrap Metal}} [[Scrap Metal]] and [[Pistol Billionaire]]s drop {{Gunpowder}} [[Gunpowder]].
* The Port Town is the only area in the [[Third Sea]] where the [[Blacksmith]] is located.
* It is highly recommended to use [[Buddha]] to grind at the Port Town because of the [[enemies]] separated from each other.
* Returning to/joining a friend in the [[Third Sea]] from the [[Second Sea]] or [[First Sea]] will teleport the player over to Port Town.
* If the player hasn't been to the [[Third Sea]] in some time, it will also set the Port Town as the players home point.


